        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Frosted Acrylic Door Handles</b>\r\n<p>\r\nPair of back to back mounted (1 handle for each side of a door) frosted acrylic door handles.  Perfect for sauna doors, wine room doors and glass doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMade in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest acrylic available. The frosted acrylic is manufacture with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions PR-CFRBAF Frosted Acrylic Door Handles\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Standard Lengths</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-PR-CFRBAF/9: Total Length 9\" - Center to Center Mount: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-PR-CFRBAF/12: Total Length 12\" - Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-PR-CFRBAF/18: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-PR-CFRBAF/24: Total Length 24\" - Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These frosted acrylic door handles are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. \r\n<br>\r\nAlso available: Individual <a href=\"/products/frosted-acrylic-door-pull-first-impressions-cfrbaf\"><b>First Impressions CFRBAF Frosted Acrylic Door Pull</b></a> for one side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting</b>.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Frosted Acrylic Door Pulls, Pair, First Impressions PR-CFRBAF",
                "description": "First Impressions CFRBAF Pair of back to back First Impressions frosted acrylic door handles. Available in 4 standard lengths of 9 inches, 12 inches, 18 inches or 24 inches. Perfect for sauna doors, wine room doors and glass doors.",
